contact3d_friction_extruded2d_widthfree.out
3D extrusion of the 2D sticking-friction test with width deformation enabled
StaticStructural nsteps 3 deltat 1 renumber 0 nmodules 2 rtolv 1e-09 stiffMode 0 manrmsteps 1 maxiter 80 initialguess 1 smtype 1
vtkxml tstep_all domain_all primvars 1 1 cellvars 4 1 150 151 152
errorcheck
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 16 nelem 4 ncrosssect 2 nmat 2 nbc 4 nic 0 nltf 2 nset 6 ncontactsurf 2
node 1 coords 3 -0.5 -0.5 -1.0
node 2 coords 3  0.5 -0.5 -1.0
node 3 coords 3  0.5  0.5 -1.0
node 4 coords 3 -0.5  0.5 -1.0
node 5 coords 3 -0.5 -0.5  0.0
node 6 coords 3  0.5 -0.5  0.0
node 7 coords 3  0.5  0.5  0.0
node 8 coords 3 -0.5  0.5  0.0
node 9 coords 3 -0.4 -0.5  0.02
node 10 coords 3  0.4 -0.5  0.02
node 11 coords 3  0.4  0.5  0.02
node 12 coords 3 -0.4  0.5  0.02
node 13 coords 3 -0.4 -0.5  0.82
node 14 coords 3  0.4 -0.5  0.82
node 15 coords 3  0.4  0.5  0.82
node 16 coords 3 -0.4  0.5  0.82
lspace 1 nodes 8 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
lspace 2 nodes 8 9 10 11 12 13 14 15 16 crosssect 1 mat 1 nlgeo 1
StructuralContactElement_QuadLinGauss 3 nodes 4 5 6 7 8 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralContactElement_QuadLinGauss 4 nodes 4 9 10 11 12 crosssect 2 mat 2 NIP 4
StructuralFEContactSurface 1 ce_set 4
StructuralFEContactSurface 2 ce_set 5
SimpleCS 1 set 6 thick 1.0 area 1.0
DummyCS 2 mat 2
mooneyrivlincompressiblemat 1 d 0 c1 1.e5 c2 0 k 1.e7
DummyMat 2
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 values 3 0 0 0 dofs 3 1 2 3 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 values 1 0 dofs 1 2 set 2
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 2 values 2 0.0001 -0.05 dofs 2 1 3 set 3
structuralpenaltycontactbc 4 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 pn 1.e8 pt 1.e5 friction 1.0 mastersurface 1 slavesurface 2 nsd 3 tangentmode 1 fdcheck 1 fdperturbation 1.e-7 fdoutputprefix "contact3d_extruded2d_widthfree_fd" fdtolerance 5.e-5
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 0.0
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 npoints 2 t 2 0 3 f(t) 2 0 1.0
set 1 nodes 4 1 2 3 4
set 2 nodes 8 1 2 5 6 9 10 13 14
set 3 nodes 4 13 14 15 16
set 4 elements 1 3
set 5 elements 1 4
set 6 elements 2 1 2
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-6
